<article class="env-lemma" id="52767A">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/52767A">Lemma <span data-tag="52767A">6.2.2.4</span>.</a> For every small $\infty $-category $\calC $, the construction $U \mapsto \calC ^{(0)}(U)$ determines a bijection between the set of equivalence classes of $(-1)$-truncated objects of $\calP (\calC )$ and the set of all sieves on $\calC $. </p>
